/Title (Warm dominant \(olive-gold undertone\), but with cool shadow counterpoint. Warm light source pushes entire lit side toward warm; shadows are cool-violet-blue cast, not grey. Saturated warm: olive-ochre-peach range. Lit cheek and temple peak in saturation. Slight golden oxidation on high points suggests natural skin luminosity. Cooler, desaturated: violet-grey undertone in eye sockets and nasolabial area. Shadow side cheek skews toward cool. Under-jaw shadow shows green-grey undertone \(cool reflected light from environment\). Facial hair: charcoal-grey at core \(chin/jaw\), warm-grey transition on cheeks with skin tone visible between hairs. Lips: warm peachy undertone, darker in shadow. Eyes: medium-dark iris with glossy quality. Collar/garment: warm white/cream with subtle warm reflected color bounce onto lower jaw and neck. Highest saturation in lit cheek and temple. Mid-saturation in midtones \(forehead, mid-face\). Low saturation in deep shadows \(eye socket, under-jaw\), becoming desaturated and cool. Facial hair desaturated \(grey-brown range\). Final glaze will lower saturation overall for cohesion.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1268 0 R
/First 1275 0 R
/Last 1275 0 R
/Count -1
/Next 1276 0 R
>>
endobj
